original_source_statement_tex:
\label{lemma-flat}
Let $B \to C$ be a ring map. If
\begin{enumerate}
\item the coprojections $C \to C \otimes_B C$ are flat and
\item $B \to C$ is universally injective,
\end{enumerate}
then $B \to C$ is faithfully flat.

